[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-university-of-edinburgh-ailie-donald-scholarship-2026-application-procedures-207":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},207,"university-of-edinburgh-ailie-donald-scholarship-2026-application-procedures-207","University Of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship 2026 | Application Procedures","\u003Cp>The University of Edinburgh Allie Donald Scholarship covers the tuition fee of the selected candidate to pursue a Master’s degree at the institution, and is tenable for a whole academic year.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is applicable to master’s studies for  study in English and\u002For Historical Linguistics, within the School of Philosophy, Psychology &amp; Language Sciences.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: University of Edinburgh\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-europe\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Europe\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: united Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||   \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: All Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 2, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Ailie Donald Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Edinburgh Allie Donald Scholarship is awarded for postgraduate Master’s study in English and\u002For Historical Linguistics, within the School of Philosophy, Psychology &amp; Language Sciences\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Edinburgh supports you financially if you are admitted to one of its study programmes as an international student.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The University of Edinburgh awards scholarships, bursaries, tuition fee reductions and discounts that help you cover existing tuition and living costs.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship Benefits\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship offers the cost of tuition fee\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>University of Edinburgh Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Geographic Reference\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have, or expect to obtain a First Class Honours degree at undergraduate level or the international equivalent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have been accepted for admission on one of the following programmes of study, within the School of Philosophy, Psychology &amp; Language Sciences at the University of Edinburgh.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Preference will be given to applicants for the MSc by Research programmes and graduates of the University of Edinburgh.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the University of Edinburgh Ailie Donald Scholarship, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the information we have provided on this webpage and ensure your eligibility\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Fill the online application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>submit the application form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fregistryservices.ed.ac.uk\u002Fstudent-funding\u002Fpostgraduate\u002Fuk-eu\u002Fhumanities\u002Fphilosophy-psychology-language\u002Fdonald\">https:\u002F\u002Fregistryservices.ed.ac.uk\u002Fstudent-funding\u002Fpostgraduate\u002Fuk-eu\u002Fhumanities\u002Fphilosophy-psychology-language\u002Fdonald\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-05-04 12:53:15",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Funiversity-of-edinburgh-ailie-donald-scholarship-2026-application-procedures\u002F69f888ab9280c0.13086249_screenshot 2026-05-04 124811.png","image",